+These files are acceptable as reviewed candidate inputs, but they are not yet a published immutable rc.4 release. Candidate tests must continue to use an explicit `CURATOR_CONFORMANCE_ROOT` and record its digest. The committed default pin remains on the released prior suite until `TASK-260720-25d05o` qualifies the release and the manager-specific pin-audit tasks accept promotion.
